# Contract addresses are not env vars — they're public and live in src/lib/config.ts
# (FACTORY_ADDRESS, BUNDLER_ADDRESS). The fee wallet is read from the factory on-chain.
#
# Everything below is OPTIONAL and server-only (never sent to the browser).

# Contract reads + TON RPC — free key from @tonapibot on Telegram (needed in practice: keyless calls get rate-limited or refused)
TONCENTER_API_KEY=
# Higher TonAPI limits — free key from tonconsole.com
TONAPI_KEY=
# Enables Telegram login, the Mini App and the bot. After deploying, open
# https://<your-site>/api/telegram/setup once to connect the bot.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# Solana / EVM buys through LI.FI: the integration-string from the LI.FI partner
# portal (e.g. rocket-bird) turns on the platform fee; the API key raises limits.
LIFI_INTEGRATOR=
LIFI_API_KEY=
# Solana RPC for balance checks and buy confirmations (optional; public mainnet RPC otherwise — a Helius/QuickNode URL is more reliable)
SOLANA_RPC_URL=
